      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Allies traveling with the messenger gain a +5-foot circumstance bonus to travel Speed, to a maximum of the messenger's travel Speed. If they use the Hustle activity, they can Hustle for a minimum of 1 hour instead of the usual amount.</p>",
